<title>SINGAPORE: Wing Tai in S$4.0 mln food franchise deal.</title>
<headline>Wing Tai in S$4.0 mln food franchise deal.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property firm Wing Tai Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it would invest up to Singapore $4.0 million on a fast food franchise from Japan's Yoshinoya D&amp;C Co Ltd, which it planned to open in Singapore.</p>
<p>&quot;The exclusive franchise involves the set up and management of the Yoshinoya fast food chain here in Singapore,&quot; Wing Tai said in a statement.</p>
<p>Wing Tai said it expected to spend between S$3.0 and S$4.0 million over three years on the outlet which is scheduled to open in September.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703011)</p>
</text>
